# 统一行尾：所有文本以 LF 检出（覆盖 Windows core.autocrlf 的 CRLF 转换，
# 避免 GitHub Windows runner 上 gofmt/golangci-lint 误报）；二进制文件禁用
# diff/文本化，防止被误判为文本而行尾归一。

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
